  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_question\">\t<p>Calculez la dérivée de la fonction définie\tsur \\(\\,\\RR\\) par \\(f{\\left(x \\right)} = u{\\left(x \\right)} v{\\left(x \\right)}\\) avec&nbsp;:</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(u{\\left(x \\right)} = 2 x + 5\\)<br>\\(v{\\left(x \\right)} = 7 x + 1\\)</div>\t</div>\t<p>Les fonctions \\(u\\) et \\(v\\) sont dérivables sur \\(\\,\\RR\\): </p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><label for=\"reply1\">\\(u'(x)\\)</label> =  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"20\"></span> </div>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><label for=\"reply2\">\\(v'(x)\\)</label> =  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"20\"></span> </div>\t<p><label for=\"reply3\">On applique la formule de dérivation&nbsp;:</label></p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"1\" /> \\(f' = \\mathtt{\\text{v-uv}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"2\" /> \\(f' = \\mathtt{\\text{v+uv}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"3\" /> \\(f' = \\mathtt{\\text{v}}\\)</label></div>\t<p> La dérivée mise sous forme polynomiale développée est&nbsp;:</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><label for=\"reply4\">\\(f'(x)\\)</label> =  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"30\"></span></div>\t",
